@k.words.si.noun.1 k.words.sense word=Si pos=noun n=1 gloss="a tetravalent nonmetallic element; next to oxygen it is the most abundant element in the earth's crust; occurs in clay and feldspar and granite and quartz and sand; used as a semiconductor in transistors" synonym=silicon synonym="atomic number 14" is_a="chemical element" is_a=semiconductor core.source="wordnet 3.1"
